#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:449
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Interesting points in the area"
msgstr "Puntos interesantes en la zona"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:450
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "You may be interested in one or more of these:"
msgstr "Usted puede estar interesado en uno o más de estos:"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:451
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "City"
msgstr "Ciudad"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:452
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "The City station represents one of the most developed stations in the area. Correlating the station to olde Earth, this would be where the walled medieval area of London would have been located"
msgstr "La estación de la ciudad representa una de las estaciones más desarrolladas de la zona. Correlacionando la estación a la antigua Tierra, esto sería donde la zona medieval amurallada de Londres habría sido localizada"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:455
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Change"
msgstr "Cambio"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:456
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Much of the area's financial business is handled at the station named Change. The station name is an oblique reference to the Royal Exchange of London"
msgstr "Gran parte del negocio financiero de la zona se maneja en la estación llamada Cambio. El nombre de la estación es una referencia oblicua al Real Intercambio de Londres"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:459
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Foundling"
msgstr "Foundling"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:460
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Foundling station specializes in medical research for children. The station name honors Foundling Hospital in London, an orphanage established in 1739 by Captain Thomas Coram, a retired seaman"
msgstr "La estación de fundición se especializa en investigación médica para niños. El nombre de la estación honra al Hospital Fundador en Londres, un orfanato establecido en 1739 por el capitán Thomas Coram, un marinero retirado"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:463
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Thames"
msgstr "TEMA"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:464
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "The zone running through this area colored blue is named Thames after the river Thames in London of olde Earth. Ships should avoid entering this zoneexcept by bridges designated due to the adverse effects it has on ship systems. This is why navigation systems automatically show this region for all ships in the area."
msgstr "La zona que atraviesa esta zona de color azul se llama Támesis después del río Támesis en Londres de la vieja Tierra. Los buques deben evitar entrar en esta zona excepto por puentes designados debido a los efectos adversos que tiene en los sistemas de buques. Por eso los sistemas de navegación muestran automáticamente esta región para todos los barcos de la zona."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:467
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Covent"
msgstr "Covent"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:468
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Most of the area's food supply comes from station Covent. It specializes in hydroponics. THe station derives its name from Covent Garden from olde Earth London where fruits, vegetables and flowers were bought and sold"
msgstr "La mayor parte de la oferta de alimentos de la zona proviene de la estación Covent. Se especializa en hidropónica. La estación THe deriva su nombre de Covent Garden de Olde Earth London, donde se compraron frutas, verduras y flores y se vendieron"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:471
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Cheshire"
msgstr "Cheshire"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:472
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "You can find fine dining and drinking at Cheshire station. The name alludes to the Ye Olde Cheshire Cheese pub from London on olde earth"
msgstr "Usted puede encontrar excelente comida y bebida en la estación de Cheshire. El nombre alude al pub Ye Olde Cheshire Cheese de Londres en la tierra vieja"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:475
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Tower"
msgstr "Torre"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:476
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Station Tower serves as a residence for the wealthiest members of the London area community"
msgstr "Station Tower sirve como residencia para los miembros más ricos de la comunidad de la zona de Londres"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:483 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:610
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What do you know about unusual readings around here?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de lecturas inusuales por aquí?"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:484 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:611
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "The unusual readings happen in A2. They are sporadic, illogical, and creepy."
msgstr "Las lecturas inusuales ocurren en A2. Son esporádicas, ilógicas y espeluznantes."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:490
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "You need to stay docked for that action."
msgstr "Tienes que permanecer atracado para esa acción."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:492
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "We do not deal in weapons of mass destruction."
msgstr "No tratamos armas de destrucción en masa."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:493
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "We do not deal in weapons of mass disruption."
msgstr "No nos ocupamos de las armas de perturbación masiva."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:494
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "We do not deal in those weapons."
msgstr "No nos ocupamos de esas armas."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:501
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "All nukes are charged and primed for destruction."
msgstr "Todos los desnudos están cargados y preparados para la destrucción."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:503
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "Sorry, sir, but you are as fully stocked as I can allow."
msgstr "Lo siento, señor, pero usted está tan lleno como puedo permitir."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:508
msgctxt "needRep-comms"
msgid "Not enough reputation."
msgstr "No es suficiente reputación."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:513
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "You are fully loaded and ready to explode things."
msgstr "Estás completamente cargado y listo para explotar cosas."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:515
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid ""
"We generously resupplied you with some weapon charges.\n"
"Put them to good use."
msgstr "generosamente te resucitamos con algunos cargos de arma, ponlos a buen uso."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:523
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid ""
"Good day, officer.\n"
"If you need supplies, please dock with us first."
msgstr "Buen día, oficial, si necesita provisiones, por favor, atraque con nosotros primero."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:525
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid ""
"Greetings.\n"
"If you want to do business, please dock with us first."
msgstr "Saludos, si quieres hacer negocios, por favor, haz lo primero con nosotros."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:563
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "Can you send a supply drop? (%d rep)"
msgstr "¿Puedes enviar una gota de suministro?%d rep)"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:565
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "You need to set a waypoint before you can request backup."
msgstr "Necesitas establecer un punto de referencia antes de que puedas solicitar refuerzos."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:567
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "To which waypoint should we deliver your supplies?"
msgstr "¿A qué punto deberíamos entregar tus suministros?"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:569 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:595
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "WP %d"
msgstr "WP %d"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:577
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "We have dispatched a supply ship toward WP %d"
msgstr "Hemos enviado un barco de suministro hacia WP %d"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:579 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:600
msgctxt "needRep-comms"
msgid "Not enough reputation!"
msgstr "¡No es suficiente reputación!"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:589
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "Please send reinforcements! (%d rep)"
msgstr "¡Por favor envíe refuerzos!%d rep)"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:591
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "You need to set a waypoint before you can request reinforcements."
msgstr "Necesitas establecer un punto de referencia antes de que puedas solicitar refuerzos."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:593
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "To which waypoint should we dispatch the reinforcements?"
msgstr "¿A qué punto deberíamos enviar los refuerzos?"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:598
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "We have dispatched %s to assist at WP %d "
msgstr "Hemos enviado %s para ayudar en WP %d "

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:641
#, lua-format
msgctxt "goal-shipLog"
msgid "Your mission is to protect station Somerset in %s. Other missions may be added. Dock with Somerset for additional mission parameters. Welcome to the London area of human navy influence"
msgstr "Su misión es proteger la estación Somerset en %sSe pueden agregar otras misiones. Acoplamiento con Somerset para parámetros adicionales de la misión. Bienvenido a la zona de Londres de influencia de la marina humana"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:643 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:740 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:903 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1062 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1094
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Dock with Somerset"
msgstr "Dock con Somerset"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:650
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "Investigate unusual sensor readings near station Camden in A2"
msgstr "Investigar lecturas inusuales de sensores cerca de la estación Camden en A2"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:652
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Investigate near station Camden in A2"
msgstr "Investigar cerca de la estación Camden en A2"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:661
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Rusty Chain Link"
msgstr "Rusty Chain Link"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:661
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Translucent but glowing rusty chain link"
msgstr "Enlace de cadena oxidada transparente pero brillante"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:668
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "[Jacob Marley] Do you remember your partner from previous missions? Especially the one where Marley station was destroyed? I am doomed to haunt this area of space forever. Take care or suffer the same fate."
msgstr "[Jacob Marley] ¿Recuerda a su pareja de misiones anteriores? Especialmente el que fue destruida la estación de Marley? Estoy condenado a perseguir esta zona del espacio para siempre. Cuidar o sufrir el mismo destino."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:722
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Jacob Marley] You must defeat the chains that bind you in the form of Kraylor ships"
msgstr "[Jacob Marley] Debes derrotar las cadenas que te atan en forma de naves Kraylor"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:724
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Defeat Kraylors"
msgstr "Defeat Kraylors"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:736
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Jacob Marley] Defeating the Kraylors gives you an idea of what is to come. Return to Somerset in %s and prepare for three ghostly visits"
msgstr "[Jacob Marley] Derrotar a los Kraylors te da una idea de lo que va a venir. Volver a Somerset en %s y prepararse para tres visitas fantasmales"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:747
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "I'm guessing you handled whatever was in A2. Those unusual readings have disappeared. However, we show an unusually high level of chroniton particles near station Millbank in %s. Recommend you investigate."
msgstr "Supongo que manejaste lo que fuera en A2. Esas lecturas inusuales han desaparecido. Sin embargo, mostramos un nivel inusualmente alto de partículas de croniton cerca de la estación Millbank en %sRecomendarte que investigues."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:749
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Investigate chroniton particles near station Millbank in %s"
msgstr "Investigar partículas de croniton cerca de la estación Millbank en %s"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:758
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Tiny escape pod"
msgstr "Posita de escape pequeña"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:758
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Tiny escape pod from a previous generation"
msgstr "Un pequeño escape de una generación anterior"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:800
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "Welcome to the Christmases of your past, Scrooge"
msgstr "Bienvenido a las Navidades de tu pasado, Scrooge"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:850
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "Belle has come. Be sure she makes it to Fezziwig in %s"
msgstr "Belle ha venido, asegúrate de que se la lleve a Fezziwig. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:857
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Protect Belle"
msgstr "Proteger Belle"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:889
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "You did not protect Belle, your dearest love. HMS Scrooge experienced catastrophic environmental systems failure due to crew anguish. All of you suffocated."
msgstr "No protegiste a Belle, tu amor más querido. HMS Scrooge experimentó una falla catastrófica de sistemas ambientales debido a la angustia de la tripulación."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:900
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "You protected Belle. Somerset awaits"
msgstr "Tú protegiste a Belle."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:918
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "Our sensors indicated nebulas forming then disappearing. That is impossible, of course. We started level three diagnostics on our sensors to discover what's wrong. Just before starting the diagnostic, we picked up unusual readings near Bedlam in %s. Perhaps you should investigate"
msgstr "Nuestros sensores indicaron que las nebulosas se formaban entonces desapareciendo. Eso es imposible, por supuesto. Comenzamos nivel tres diagnósticos en nuestros sensores para descubrir lo que está mal. Justo antes de comenzar el diagnóstico, recogimos lecturas inusuales cerca de Bedlam en %s. Tal vez usted debe investigar"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:920
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Investigate unusual readings near Bedlam in %s"
msgstr "Investigar lecturas inusuales cerca de Bedlam en %s"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:927
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] Happy Christmas, Scrooge! You are just in time to make our holiday bright. I know it is against your nature, but surely you can decorate our skies with alien enemy ship explosions. In the worst case, we will get a sky decorated with your ship exploding."
msgstr "[Bob Cratchit en la estación Bedlam] Feliz Navidad, Scrooge! Usted está justo a tiempo para hacer nuestras vacaciones brillantes. Sé que es contra su naturaleza, pero seguro que puede decorar nuestros cielos con explosiones de naves enemigas alienígenas. En el peor de los casos, conseguiremos un cielo decorado con su explosión de barco."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:936
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Destroy marauding enemies"
msgstr "Destruir enemigos saqueadores"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:965
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] I hate to dampen your spirits, but my young maintenance technician, Tim, has become seriously ill. Our medical facilities cannot diagnose, much less treat him. The medical ship Turkey Surprise should be able to help. Could you dock with Bedlam and transport Tim to Turkey Surprise?"
msgstr "[Bob Cratchit en la estación de Bedlam] Odio humedecer sus espíritus, pero mi joven técnico de mantenimiento, Tim, se ha vuelto gravemente enfermo. Nuestras instalaciones médicas no pueden diagnosticar, mucho menos tratarlo. El barco médico Turquía Sorpresa debe ser capaz de ayudar. ¿Podría usted atracar con Bedlam y transportar Tim a Turquía Sorpresa?"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:973
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Take Tim from Bedlam to Turkey Surprise"
msgstr "Tome Tim de Bedlam a Turquía Sorpresa"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:981
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "While you fought off the ships near Bedlam, Tiny Tim, Bob Cratchit's maintenance technician perished along with the others aboard station Bedlam. Your engineering crew were so overcome with grief that they neglected a routie maintenance cycle causing engine failure on HMS Scrooge."
msgstr "Mientras luchaba contra los barcos cerca de Bedlam, Tiny Tim, el técnico de mantenimiento de Bob Cratchit pereció junto con los otros a bordo de la estación Bedlam. Su equipo de ingeniería fue tan superado con el dolor que descuidaron un ciclo de mantenimiento routie causando falla del motor en HMS Scrooge."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:992
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit] Tim has been transported aboard %s. Hurry to Turkey Surprise. The doctors say he has about %i seconds to live"
msgstr "Tim ha sido transportado a bordo %s. Apúrate a Turquía Sorpresa. %i segundos para vivir"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:995
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit] Tim has been transported aboard %s. Hurry to Turkey Surprise. The doctors say he has about %i minutes to live"
msgstr "Tim ha sido transportado a bordo %s. Apúrate a Turquía Sorpresa. %i minutos para vivir"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:997
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit] Tim has been transported aboard %s. Hurry to Turkey Surprise. The doctors say he has about %i minute to live"
msgstr "Tim ha sido transportado a bordo %s. Apúrate a Turquía Sorpresa. %i minuto para vivir"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1004
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit] Please hurry, the doctors say Tim has less than %i seconds to live"
msgstr "Por favor, date prisa, los doctores dicen que Tim tiene menos que %i segundos para vivir"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1011
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "[Sick Bay] Tim has less than %i seconds to live"
msgstr "Tim tiene menos que %i segundos para vivir"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1019 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1069
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "[Turkey Surprise] We cannot transport through your shields. Please lower them"
msgstr "No podemos transportarlos a través de sus escudos."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1023
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Turkey Surprise] We have transported Tim and our doctors are examining him"
msgstr "Hemos transportado a Tim y nuestros médicos lo están examinando."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1027
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Protect Turkey Surprise"
msgstr "Protege la sorpresa de Turquía"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1032 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1051 scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1078
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Tim dies with Turkey Surprise. %s disabled by a broken heart (engine failure)"
msgstr "Tim muere con Turquía Sorpresa. %s discapacitado por un corazón roto (insuficiencia del motor)"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1037
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Tim dies. %s disabled by a broken heart (engine failure)"
msgstr "Tim muere. %s discapacitado por un corazón roto (insuficiencia del motor)"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1043
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit] Turkey Surprise tells me Tim is doing fine. In fact, he's ready to return to duty. We need him here for critical repairs. Would you bring him home, please?"
msgstr "Turquía Sorpresa me dice que Tim está bien. De hecho, está listo para volver al servicio. Lo necesitamos aquí para reparaciones críticas. ¿Lo llevarías a casa, por favor?"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1048
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Return Tim to Bedlam"
msgstr "Regresar a Tim a Bedlam"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1058
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Bob Cratchit] We are so glad Tim is better. He serves a critical role here. Somerset is looking for you"
msgstr "Estamos tan contentos de que Tim sea mejor. Él sirve un papel crítico aquí."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1073
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "[Transporter Room] Tim has been transported aboard. Bedlam is wating for us to bring him back to work on repairs"
msgstr "Tim ha sido transportado a bordo. Bedlam nos está saludando para traerlo de vuelta a trabajar en reparaciones."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1096
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "We are glad you took care of those Ghosts in the machine. They came out of nowhere! We still saw some impossible sensor readings even after our sensor overhaul. We are now conducting a level 5 diagnostic and repair regimen. Keep an eye on the City in %s"
msgstr "Estamos contentos de que cuidó de esos fantasmas en la máquina. Ellos salieron de la nada! Todavía vimos algunas lecturas de sensores imposibles incluso después de nuestra revisión del sensor. Ahora estamos llevando a cabo un nivel 5 de diagnóstico y el régimen de reparación. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1098
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Watch the City in %s"
msgstr "Mira la ciudad en %s"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1158
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "Face your future"
msgstr "Enfrente a tu futuro"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1316
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "You have faced your future"
msgstr "Has enfrentado a tu futuro."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1339
msgctxt "return-shipLog"
msgid "Dock at Somerset for a well deserved Christmas break"
msgstr "Dock en Somerset para un merecido descanso navideño"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1346
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Jacob Marley] Good to see you spreading joy and easing pain, Scrooge"
msgstr "[Jacob Marley] Me alegro de verte propagando alegría y aliviar el dolor, Scrooge"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1355
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "May the shadows of the things that have been continue to remind you of the joy of Christmas"
msgstr "Que las sombras de las cosas que han sido continuadas recordando la alegría de la Navidad"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1364
msgctxt "return-shipLog"
msgid "Despite Ignorance and Want, prisons and workhouses, know each day fully and celebrate it, especially Christmas"
msgstr "A pesar de Ignorance y Want, las prisiones y los centros de trabajo, conocer todos los días y celebrarlo, especialmente Navidad"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1372
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Urchin Express]\n"
"Happy Christmas, sir!\n"
"Top o' the day to ya!\n"
"Thanks for the shillings!"
msgstr "¡Feliz Navidad, señor!"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1381
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Fred from QE17] Merry Christmas, uncle! Stop by and share Christmas dinner with us when you're off duty"
msgstr "¡Feliz Navidad, tío! Pase y comparta la cena de Navidad con nosotros cuando esté fuera de servicio"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1390
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Bob on Cratchit Cruiser] Happy Christmas, Mr. Scrooge. Thanks for the raise and for helping Tiny Tim"
msgstr "Feliz Navidad, Sr. Scrooge. Gracias por el aumento y por ayudar a Tiny Tim"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1399
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Tim on Cratchit Cruiser] God bless us every one"
msgstr "Dios nos bendiga a todos."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1409
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Tim on Cratchit Cruiser] Give me some freakin' eggnog"
msgstr "Dame un maldito huevo."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1418
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Merry Christmas!"
msgstr "¡Feliz Navidad!"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1516
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "How dare you bring us here!"
msgstr "¡Cómo te atreves a traernos aquí!"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1525
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "Silence! Since we are here, let us destroy Somerset"
msgstr "Silencio, ya que estamos aquí, destruyamos a Somerset"

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1568
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "Dock with Graveyard, Cemetery and Necropolis."
msgstr "Pato con Cementerio, Cementerio y Necrópolis."

#: scripts/scenario_62_whatTheDickens.lua:1580
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Somerset destroyed. %s dishonored and meaner. Christmas is ruined"
msgstr "Somerset destruyó. %s Navidad está arruinada"
